  "name": "Creamy Brioche Bread Sauce",
  "subtitle": "A smooth, aromatic sauce with buttery brioche",
  "description": "Brioche is simmered with infused milk, butter, cream, and nutmeg for a rich bread sauce suitable for serving alongside a main dish.",
